      "sourceTextSha256": "acaf23e4eb3ff3b8c37ecfe00ed765802d6108cb435656eaa76bd1f1f6ae0b18",
      "text": "Day 9 · Breakfast, then a city tour with an English-speaking guide: La Moneda Palace, built at the end of the colonial period as the royal mint and the seat of government since the mid-19th century; the Plaza de Armas, with the Cathedral, the Post Office and the old Royal Audiencia; Santa Lucía Hill, with its panorama of the city; and the modern districts of Vitacura, Las Condes and Providencia. Optional: Maipo Valley wineries with tasting (USD 230 per person, minimum 2).",
